  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s goals arecomma firstcomma to bring about effective health sector decentralization in the provinces of North Sumateracomma West Javacomma and Banten. The challenge is to initiate key sector reforms and put health financing on a firm footingcomma while protecting health services which are  essential for the poor anf the  public at large during a period of government restructuring. The second objective is to help the Ministry of Health carry out its role in a decentralized system. These responsibilities encompass providing sectoral vision and leadershipcomma analysis and policy follow up of the health needs of the poor and risks to the public at largecomma advocacy of best practices and standardscomma and support for local initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
